{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-03-24 20:59:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES EXCHANGE RATIOS FOR ISHARES ETF MERGERS', 'text': 'TORONTO, MARCH 24, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (“BLACKROCK”) (NYSE: BLK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXCHANGE RATIOS FOR THE MERGERS OF CERTAIN ISHARES EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS.'}